# .graphifyignore for TI_Engine_Charts
# Goal: focus Graphify on editable source, scripts, tests, and selected
# human-authored project docs.
#
# Intentional inclusions:
# - tools/ and scripts/ remain visible because they define the build/verify flow.
# - dev-docs/, README.md, and AGENTS.md remain visible as architecture/context docs.
# - data/preset_library.json remains visible as the only hand-maintained data file.
#
# Intentional exclusions:
# - docs/ is the generated GitHub Pages output.
# - data/generated/ contains generated Terra Invicta catalogs.
# - .github/ contains process/hosting metadata rather than app structure.

# VCS / dependencies / local env
.git/
node_modules/
.venv*/
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.cache/
.DS_Store

# Generated GitHub Pages output
/docs/

# Generated Terra Invicta data
/data/generated/

# Tool state and repo-local handoff artifacts
.serena/
.chatgpt/
.codex/

# Temporary planning docs; keep durable human-authored docs visible.
dev-docs/plan/

# GitHub/process metadata noise
.github/

# Dependency lockfiles are bulky dependency snapshots; package.json is enough
# for Graphify's project-structure context.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Human-authored development docs are intentionally kept visible:
# README.md, AGENTS.md, and dev-docs/ are not ignored.

# Browser/test artifacts
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/

# Runtime/build/cache artifacts
dist/
build/
*.map
*.tmp
*.temp

# Archives / local transfer artifacts / logs
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Graphify output/cache
graphify-out/
.graphify/